abstract: >-
  Code, serialization-invariant activity-cliff labels, split assignments, result tables and
  per-molecule predictions for an analysis of how SMILES serialization changes the activity-cliff
  annotations of the MoleculeACE benchmark (upstream commit 7e6de0bd2968c56589c580f2a397f01c531ede26).
